# the image is built from a handful of files; send nothing else to the builder
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!lineage_check/
!enclave/requirements.txt
!enclave/lineage_service.py
!enclave/concern-demo.json
!watchlists/
!enclave/no-model/
# a private model placed here is sealed into the image with --build-arg MODEL_SRC=enclave/mounted
!enclave/mounted/
!tools/build_ggml.sh
